# Quilled Greatwurm: "Whenever a creature you control deals combat damage during your turn, put that many +1/+1 counters on it. (It must
# survive to get the counters.)" On turn 3 Bot1 attacks with the Greatwurm and a Memnite. One of Bot2's Grizzly Bears blocks the
# Greatwurm, which assigns 2 to it and tramples 5 over to Bot2: it dealt 7 at once and gets seven counters (CR 510.2, 702.19b). The other
# Bear blocks the Memnite: the Memnite deals 1 and is killed by the Bear's 2, so it has no counter to get; the surviving Bear
# dealt combat damage during Bot1's turn too, but it is not Bot1's creature and gets none.

[Bot1 Deck]
Black Lotus
Mox Emerald
Mox Jet
Mox Ruby
Quilled Greatwurm
Memnite
Island x21

[Bot2 Deck]
